Cell["\<\
Define exact ground and excited states, and the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Thermal Sink\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96408298797011*^9, 
  3.9640829974651823`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ef54b1fa-2dc5-424f-8a8f-\
